# Nothing this plugin generates belongs in the repository. It writes runtime
# state to $XDG_STATE_HOME/omarchy-speaker-mode and cached cover art to
# $XDG_CACHE_HOME/omarchy-speaker-mode, both outside the plugin directory —
# these entries are here in case anything is ever run from inside a checkout.
*.log
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
!preview.png

